  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "305期封面作品名稱：紅龜粿、紅圓kap麻糬 祝lán逐家中秋團圓"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjuvjBavAtptT1WrS_EkEPL8MyKes-CwUrwZ76X1QIMgfC8qIOVIZdy3NRs1AzH2VhWbVU5aju8MxVIldjpGqMXxGhYps2KvcJzX_IYijMh8FfWrt0LIO5XFk0kVkFNXlh43zvKECr7sIoL/s1600/%25E7%25B4%2585%25E9%25BE%259C%25E7%25B2%25BF%25E4%25B8%2580%25E5%25AE%25B6%25E6%2597%258F-%25E4%25B8%25AD%25E7%25A7%258B%2528%25E6%259C%2589LOGO%2529.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1123\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"448\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjuvjBavAtptT1WrS_EkEPL8MyKes-CwUrwZ76X1QIMgfC8qIOVIZdy3NRs1AzH2VhWbVU5aju8MxVIldjpGqMXxGhYps2KvcJzX_IYijMh8FfWrt0LIO5XFk0kVkFNXlh43zvKECr7sIoL/s640/%25E7%25B4%2585%25E9%25BE%259C%25E7%25B2%25BF%25E4%25B8%2580%25E5%25AE%25B6%25E6%2597%258F-%25E4%25B8%25AD%25E7%25A7%258B%2528%25E6%259C%2589LOGO%2529.png\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<br />\n<b>作品名稱</b><br />\n<br />\n紅龜粿、紅圓kap麻糬祝lán逐家中秋團圓<br />\n<b><br /></b>\n<b>作品簡介</b><br />\n<br />\n紅龜粿ê紅色代表吉祥，龜印代表長歲壽。麻糍是土地公伯--à愛食ê食mi̍h，白色代表白銀，有富貴ê意思。Lán若生囡仔、滿月、度tsè，lóng ē做紅龜粿kap紅圓送hōo親tsiânn好朋友。今年中秋節紅龜粿、紅圓kap麻糍祝lán逐家中秋團圓。<br />\n<br />\n<b>創作方式</b><br />\n<br />\nEasy Paint Tool SAI&nbsp; kap Adobe Illustrator電腦繪圖<br />\n<br />\n<b>尺寸</b><br />\n<br />\n19cmX13cm<br />\n<br />\n<b>年代</b><br />\n<br />\n2019年<br />\n<br />\n<b>作者簡介</b><br />\n<br />\n劉素珍，高雄師範大學台文所ê研究生，2015年接觸台語，tsiah知影台語原來有文字，目前是幼兒園、國小、國中ê台語老師，台語囡仔古故事角講古ê老師，作品有台語繪本《來tshit-thô》、LINE原創貼圖「紅龜粿一家族」、「紅龜粿來tsò-tseh」。<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgAo6GiariUINIiv0QXYRnrORub0aMQe4hA3xgKXAfkBYAlgYd4Zi7CrzK-JA3_AIAp1CHDQAq9J5YmsK5HSvtzUg8OOiQUIqPMH62aCHyL2rEmKm0iCR5M0I51oySELIxDJOuh6SmB3h-Y/s1600/%25E7%25B4%2585%25E9%25BE%259C%25E7%25B2%25BF%25E4%25B8%2580%25E5%25AE%25B6%25E6%2597%258F-%25E7%25AC%25AC%25E4%25B8%2580%25E5%25BD%2588QRcode.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1155\" data-original-width=\"1155\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgAo6GiariUINIiv0QXYRnrORub0aMQe4hA3xgKXAfkBYAlgYd4Zi7CrzK-JA3_AIAp1CHDQAq9J5YmsK5HSvtzUg8OOiQUIqPMH62aCHyL2rEmKm0iCR5M0I51oySELIxDJOuh6SmB3h-Y/s320/%25E7%25B4%2585%25E9%25BE%259C%25E7%25B2%25BF%25E4%25B8%2580%25E5%25AE%25B6%25E6%2597%258F-%25E7%25AC%25AC%25E4%25B8%2580%25E5%25BD%2588QRcode.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg2qm4AInrYTZNbUv4rZnwJysS-NDm9TRnIpMOaMn6SAu27fvDJQu5JRPrVSGtJ_9nx1SEB6ICp_3v3hj3cDK5Ssl44Fha99AqG5E36y-kYmbMF5HLCe_OLrCUwly8r4gQw-5aXfxTPjfkw/s1600/305%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1001\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg2qm4AInrYTZNbUv4rZnwJysS-NDm9TRnIpMOaMn6SAu27fvDJQu5JRPrVSGtJ_9nx1SEB6ICp_3v3hj3cDK5Ssl44Fha99AqG5E36y-kYmbMF5HLCe_OLrCUwly8r4gQw-5aXfxTPjfkw/s320/305%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"224\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9Nz